<title>CHINA: HK DAILY NEWS YEAR NET LOSS HK$131.83 MLN.</title>
<headline>HK DAILY NEWS YEAR NET LOSS HK$131.83 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   41.4 loss   vs 42.6 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  13.53 loss  vs 2.41 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    131.83 loss vs 113.65 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     416.19	vs 842.42</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hong Kong Daily News Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong Daily News is a printer and newspaper publisher.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for advances and accrued interest receivable due from minority shareholders of a subsidiary.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
